│   25       has no UTC offset, and a tz-aware datetime otherwise; it raises ValueErro │
│   26       on malformed input.                                                       │
│   27     - ciso8601.parse_datetime returns the same shape of result (tz-naive if no  │
│   28       offset present, tz-aware otherwise), but raises its own parse error types │
│   29       (e.g. ValueError subclasses or, in some versions, a generic exception)    │
│   30       rather than guaranteeing a plain ValueError.                              │
│   31                                                                                 │
│   32     This wrapper calls ciso8601.parse_datetime and normalizes any parsing       │
