    │   converting calling code to async/await
    └── The file uses requests.Session() injected as a session object, with synchronous 
        .get/.post calls, .raise_for_status(), and .json() parsing. httpx provides a 
        near drop-in sync API via httpx.Client() with equivalent methods and can be used
        synchronously (httpx.Client() instead of requests.Session()), making it a 
        genuine substitute for this usage pattern.

